# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24
direction: down
title: "Native ASCENT compiler product admission" {shape: text}
inputs: "Native package pins + immutable SDK + runner platform\nAitia gerbil.pkg owns ASP and Yuanxu requirements"
cache: "Restored cache is unadmitted input\nDirectory / SSI presence is insufficient"
spec: "ASCENT build.ss spec\nSelect actual gxc library units\nKeep executable-only targets distinct"
core: "Existing Yuanxu Core\nrequire-build-products!\nRuntime and macro-phase product family"
repair: "Core invalidates affected native markers\nSDK std/make consumes original gxc declarations and options\nAll 134 libraries; no executable delivery receipt\n2 GiB heap / 180 seconds; failure stays failure"
negative: "Real eqrel family -> accept\nRemove eqrel~1.o1 -> reject\nInvalidate without compile -> still reject"
source: "Git source custody / canonical input path spelling\nNo tracked SSI / ssxi / dynamic objects\nPreserve authored SCM fixtures"
admit: "Complete native products + independent controls\nSave reusable artifacts; never cache a verdict"
asp: "Manifest-owned Core and ASP revisions\nSDK pkg-update + pkg-build / Core gitlink equality\nActual native manifest and original package build\nGlobal editor TAGS is a separate demand"
parent: "Aitia production + integration specs + existing test discovery\nCore for-each-build-module -> original parent spec / FFI options\nObserved: 33 test files / 116 entries / 109 parent libraries\nSDK metadata-only SPI is pinned and explicit; no fabricated manifest"
lock: "Native Sources Lock / unchanged six HTML payloads\nIndependent byte SHA256 oracle: 197,510 bytes\nShared generated-input POO declaration -> std/make extra-inputs\nRecompile sources and dependents; old lock receipts stay historical"
lifecycle: "Existing native build owns driver + unchanged assertions\nQuint/TLC: 19,042 states / 16 actions / original 3,084 traces\n21 fields each row / 7 faults / false-gold refusal\nPOO child Profile 2 GiB + Python/native deadline 180s\n160-step batches / 4 workers / CI job 90 minutes"
consumer: "Aitia semantic / integration / native runtime CI\nExact-head remote acceptance required\nCold-install budget remains a separate obligation"
inputs -> cache
inputs -> spec
cache -> core
spec -> core
core -> repair: "incomplete"
repair -> core: "recheck"
core -> admit: "complete"
negative -> admit
source -> admit
admit -> asp
asp -> parent
parent -> lock
lock -> lifecycle
lifecycle -> consumer
